      "writtenOn": "2020-07-10T09:35:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason for must always be set to \"both\" on the device was that was the behavior that was present before I refactored the code so I preserved that because I thought that was important. It turns out that it was not particularly important. I special cased the snapshot generation code to not output \"both\" and instead rely on the device default in order to avoid changing the behavior of the tests in the refactoring.",
